{"id":"5.3.4","doc":"T","title":"eFuse VDDQ Timing","words":145,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The "},{"t":"block","v":"eFuse","id":"efuse"},{"t":"text","v":" Controller operates with "},{"t":"num","v":"20 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":", one cycle is "},{"t":"num","v":"50 ns","k":"time"},{"t":"text","v":", and its programming voltage VDDQ should be configured as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_DAC_NUM"},{"t":"text","v":" (store the rising period of VDDQ): The default value of VDDQ is "},{"t":"num","v":"2.5 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" and the voltage increases by "},{"t":"num","v":"0.01 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" in each clock cycle."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Thus, the default value of this parameter is 255;"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_DAC_CLK_DIV"},{"t":"text","v":" (the clock divisor of VDDQ): The clock period to program VDDQ should be larger than "},{"t":"num","v":"1 µs","k":"time"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_PWR_ON_NUM"},{"t":"text","v":" (the power-up time for VDDQ): The programming voltage should be stabilized after this time, which means the value of this parameter should be configured to exceed the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_DAC_CLK_DIV"},{"t":"text","v":" multiply by "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_DAC_NUM"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_PWR_OFF_NUM"},{"t":"text","v":" (the power-out time for VDDQ): The value of this parameter should be larger than "},{"t":"num","v":"10 µs","k":"time"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 5.3-5. Configuration of Default VDDQ Timing Parameters","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"EFUSE_DAC_NUM"}],[{"t":"text","v":"EFUSE_DAC_CLK_DIV"}],[{"t":"text","v":"EFUSE_PWR_ON_NUM"}],[{"t":"text","v":"EFUSE_PWR_OFF_NUM"}]],"rows":[{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0xFF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x28"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x3000"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x190"}]]}]}]}